## Run it on your computer

You need: {{PREREQUISITES}}.

```bash
{{INSTALL_COMMAND}}
{{DEV_COMMAND}}
```

Then open {{LOCAL_URL}}. Run the tests with `{{TEST_COMMAND}}` and the platform checks with
`platform check` before committing.

There is no company sign-in on your computer: the settings `DEV_FAKE_USER` (an email) and
`DEV_FAKE_ROLES` (comma-separated roles) decide who you are. Local settings: {{LOCAL_SETTINGS}}.

## Deploying

There is nothing to deploy by hand. Pushing a branch deploys it to the test environment
(nonprod); merging into the default branch requests a production release, which the platform team
approves. See the portal for status, history and rollback.

